@startuml
title UC02 - one paid cycle per intent (REVIEW)
autonumber
actor "CSKH application" as C
participant "Subscription service" as S
participant "Operation outcomes" as O
participant "Package catalog / policy" as P
participant "MAIN account" as A
participant "Subscription root / cycles" as R
participant "Financial history" as L
C -> S : read catalog and current subscription
S -> R : version / coverageEnd / currentCycle
S --> C : current terms + expectedVersion
C -> S : purchase(requestId, subscriber, package, expectedVersion)
S -> O : authorize caller; resolve key + canonical content
alt replay / conflict / still processing
 O --> S : saved outcome / conflict / PROCESSING
 S --> C : no new fee
else new operation
 S -> P : authoritative current terms + sales/grandfather eligibility
 group atomic purchase responsibility
  S -> A : coordinate MAIN, verify owner (eligibility rechecked after all locks)
  S -> R : serialize subscriber/package intent, compare expectedVersion
  alt stale version / pending cancellation / invalid policy
   R --> S : conflict, no fee/cycle
   S -> O : terminal failure
  else valid state
   S -> A : fresh DB eligibility AFTER all root/cycle coordination; recheck expiry/funds
   S -> R : start=coverageEnd if continuous, else this valid processing instant
   S -> R : end=localDate(start)+durationDays at midnight
   S -> A : deduct one MAIN fee
   S -> L : PACKAGE_FEE + recordedAt + balanceBefore/After
   S -> R : immutable paid cycle; advance coverageEnd/version
   S -> O : SUCCEEDED linked to cycle and fee
  end
 end
 S --> C : committed outcome
end
note over S,R
 Manual/worker targeting same next cycle: one fee only.
 Losing request re-evaluates/conflicts, never silently buys another cycle.
 Any failure rolls back fee/cycle/root/outcome effects consistently.
end note
@enduml
